# Build context for core-app/Dockerfile and risk-aml-service/Dockerfile is dev/ (they need the parent pom,
# event-contracts and the Maven wrapper). Only what the build stage copies is needed; above all, secrets and
# local state must never reach the context (an image layer or the build cache would keep them).

# Secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
http/http-client.private.env.json

# Build output, made fresh inside the build stage
**/target/

# Tests are not compiled for the image (-Dmaven.test.skip=true)
**/src/test/

# Everything that isn't source code of the three Maven modules
.git
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.claude/
docs/
http/
infra/
load-tests/
scripts/
*.md
!**/src/**/*.md
**/Dockerfile
.dockerignore
